---
description: FastAPI Synqed-style module layering for Kissa backend
globs: backend/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# Backend modules

- Layering: `api` (thin) → `services` → `repository` / `integrations`
- Schemas in `app/schemas/`; ORM in `app/repository/models/`
- **Repos never `commit`** — `get_db_session` commits on success / rolls back on error
- Config in `app/core/config.py`; normalize DB URLs to `postgresql+asyncpg` + `ssl=require` when needed
- Product routes under `/api/v1/…`; keep `/api/health` for probes
- ARQ jobs: define in `worker/settings.py`, enqueue from `services/`
- Do not add Cognito/JWT/auth middleware
